==============

Thanks to a suggestion of Andrew Sterian, 'ePiX' is extensible.  User
extensions span a spectrum, from header files that require only basic
knowledge of 'C++' to separately compiled libraries that add substantial
new features.  The structure of the source code is outlined in Section
